{"id": "wehope-insider-building", "title": "Shelter operator bought a $4.6M building stake from an officer’s relative’s company", "seconds": 130.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "tempo": 1.023, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "0c62c55881244861", "words": 375, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "WeHOPE is a nonprofit that runs shelters for San Francisco.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.4, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "WeHOPE", "sub": "runs shelter sites for San Francisco"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.51, 0.61, 1.2, 1.38, 1.61, 1.99, 2.17, 2.4]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "Since fiscal 2021, the City has paid it 19.1 million dollars.", "t0": 3.52, "t1": 8.43, "shot": "b0x", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "WeHOPE", "sub": "runs shelter sites for San Francisco"}, "emph": ["19.1 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.64, 0.95, 1.94, 2.06, 2.35, 2.51, 2.73, 2.83, 3.3, 3.62, 3.85, 4.32]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[1]", "oneLine"], "text": "On its own tax return, it reported a building deal with a company tied to its leaders. How big?", "t0": 8.55, "t1": 14.02, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "A building deal with insiders", "sub": "its own 2024 tax return"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.26, 0.45, 0.74, 1.34, 1.44, 1.9, 1.98, 2.39, 2.66, 2.8, 2.91, 3.27, 3.61, 3.7, 3.86, 4.63, 5.06]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "established[0]"], "text": "About 4.6 million dollars.", "t0": 14.02, "t1": 16.75, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$4,555,548", "label": "with a company 35% controlled by an officer’s relative"}, "emph": ["About"], "wt": [0.04, 0.74, 0.99, 1.36, 1.53, 2.01]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 17.27, "t1": 19.05, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.3, 0.41, 0.92, 1.08, 1.18]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "count", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "Every dollar of that 19.1 million, the records show, came from the City’s homelessness department.", "t0": 19.27, "t1": 25.1, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "$19.1 million", "label": "paid by the homelessness department, fiscal 2021 to 2027 to date"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.57, 0.7, 0.87, 1.28, 1.65, 1.82, 2.38, 2.52, 2.92, 3.53, 3.77, 3.97, 4.09, 4.46, 5.02]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "It got nothing before 2021.", "t0": 25.22, "t1": 27.23, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "City payments", "rows": [["Fiscal 2026", "5.5"], ["Fiscal 2021", "1.1"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.32, 0.64, 0.94, 1.19]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "Then 1.1 million dollars that year, and 5.5 million in 2026.", "t0": 27.35, "t1": 32.98, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "City payments", "rows": [["Fiscal 2026", "5.5"], ["Fiscal 2021", "1.1"]]}, "emph": ["5.5 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.59, 0.84, 1.07, 1.46, 1.83, 2.02, 2.77, 2.94, 3.19, 3.56, 3.8, 4.25, 4.49, 4.72]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]"], "text": "The first lead is the building. The deal was with a company called Action Associates.", "t0": 33.2, "t1": 37.79, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Action Associates Inc", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "35% controlled entity owned by a family member of an officer/board member"}, "wt": [0.03, 0.1, 0.4, 0.62, 0.69, 0.81, 1.51, 1.73, 2.02, 2.15, 2.29, 2.41, 2.74, 3.16, 3.76]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]"], "text": "It’s 35 percent controlled by a family member of a WeHOPE officer.", "t0": 37.91, "t1": 41.79, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Action Associates Inc", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "35% controlled entity owned by a family member of an officer/board member"}, "emph": ["family member"], "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.67, 1.12, 1.57, 1.66, 1.76, 2.15, 2.51, 2.6, 2.72, 3.17]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "The return says it bought an ownership interest in a building.", "t0": 41.91, "t1": 44.67, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "ownership interest in building purchased"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.51, 0.72, 0.82, 1.11, 1.21, 1.68, 2.05, 2.14, 2.22]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]", "story[4]"], "text": "County records show three deeds from Action Associates to WeHOPE:", "t0": 44.79, "t1": 48.86, "shot": "b9a", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "w6a", "kicker": "San Mateo County recorder · Action Associates Inc to WeHOPE", "text": "deeds recorded 2018-09-28, 2024-10-18 and 2024-10-18", "mark": "2018-09-28"}, "emph": ["three deeds"], "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.73, 0.91, 1.24, 1.59, 1.76, 2.09, 2.79, 2.97]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]", "story[4]"], "text": "one in 2018, two in 2024.", "t0": 48.86, "t1": 52.13, "shot": "b9a", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "w6a", "kicker": "San Mateo County recorder · Action Associates Inc to WeHOPE", "text": "deeds recorded 2018-09-28, 2024-10-18 and 2024-10-18", "mark": "2018-09-28"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.21, 0.35, 0.6, 1.62, 1.9, 2.14, 2.38]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[4]", "story[4]", "established[6]"], "text": "The same day, two deeds of trust were recorded: a sign of a lender financing it.", "t0": 52.25, "t1": 57.4, "shot": "b9b", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "w6a", "kicker": "San Mateo County recorder · the same day", "text": "18 October 2024: two deeds of trust, an assignment, a subordination agreement and two reconveyances or substitutions of trustee", "mark": "two deeds of trust"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.43, 1.11, 1.34, 1.62, 1.74, 2.08, 2.2, 3.24, 3.38, 3.66, 3.75, 3.85, 4.31, 4.85]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "Why does that matter? When a charity buys from its own leaders’ family, no market sets the price.", "t0": 57.52, "t1": 62.64, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "housing", "name": "WeHOPE", "sub": "the buyer"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Action Associates Inc", "sub": "an officer’s relative"}, {"art": "question", "name": "The price", "sub": "not set by a market"}], "kicker": "Why it matters"}, "emph": ["no market"], "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.23, 0.4, 0.95, 1.17, 1.29, 1.64, 1.97, 2.07, 2.25, 2.46, 3.0, 3.52, 3.74, 4.19, 4.4, 4.53]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["story[3]"], "text": "The deal equals a third of a year’s revenue. Did independent directors approve it?", "t0": 62.76, "t1": 67.32, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the form asks no such question about the building transaction"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.39, 0.77, 0.86, 1.14, 1.24, 1.32, 1.65, 2.49, 2.88, 3.36, 3.89, 4.19]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["story[3]", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "The form doesn’t ask, so the return doesn’t say.", "t0": 67.32, "t1": 70.59, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the form asks no such question about the building transaction"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.69, 0.98, 1.35, 1.77, 1.9, 2.02, 2.45, 2.8]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]"], "text": "The second lead is a loan: 415,000 dollars from United Hope Builders.", "t0": 70.81, "t1": 76.46, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "A bridge loan", "kicker": "The second lead", "chip": "$415,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.46, 0.72, 0.92, 1.05, 1.94, 2.17, 2.5, 2.96, 3.43, 3.83, 4.16, 4.68, 4.92]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]"], "text": "WeHOPE’s own founders co-founded it.", "t0": 76.58, "t1": 78.87, "shot": "b11x", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "A bridge loan", "kicker": "The second lead", "chip": "$415,000"}, "emph": ["co-founded"], "wt": [0.0, 0.48, 0.76, 1.26, 1.86]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "So the same people sit on both sides of the debt.", "t0": 78.99, "t1": 81.44, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "United Hope Builders Inc", "sub": "the lender"}, {"art": "question", "name": "Same founders", "sub": "both sides"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "WeHOPE", "sub": "the borrower"}], "kicker": "The second lead"}, "emph": ["both sides"], "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.25, 0.54, 0.87, 1.1, 1.25, 1.5, 1.85, 1.92, 2.05]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "438,733 dollars is still due.", "t0": 81.56, "t1": 85.9, "shot": "b12x", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "United Hope Builders Inc", "sub": "the lender"}, {"art": "question", "name": "Same founders", "sub": "both sides"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "WeHOPE", "sub": "the borrower"}], "kicker": "The second lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.48, 0.96, 1.52, 1.94, 2.19, 2.74, 3.19, 3.45, 3.79]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "The third lead is how it got City work.", "t0": 86.12, "t1": 88.58, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "No bid", "kicker": "The third lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.42, 0.81, 1.01, 1.18, 1.32, 1.5, 1.83]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "Of 19.1 million dollars paid, how much came with no bidding?", "t0": 88.58, "t1": 93.26, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "No bid", "kicker": "The third lead"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.51, 0.97, 1.22, 1.45, 1.9, 2.27, 2.98, 3.08, 3.32, 3.54, 3.74, 3.95]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "story[0]"], "text": "14.5 million dollars.", "t0": 93.26, "t1": 95.99, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$14.5 million", "label": "under emergency procurement or the homelessness waiver", "sub": "76% of the payments with an award method"}, "emph": ["14.5"], "wt": [0.04, 1.01, 1.38, 1.62, 2.02]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "The biggest was SIP Services, at 7,235,572 dollars.", "t0": 96.51, "t1": 100.91, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Contracts", "rows": [["SIP Services (2020)", "7235572"], ["Non-Congregate Shelter (2022)", "5439863"], ["Monarch (2025)", "5169233"]]}, "emph": ["7,235,572"], "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.53, 0.88, 1.47, 2.29, 2.38, 2.63, 2.94, 3.24, 3.41, 3.81]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "No bidding, fast growth, and insider deals. That’s the mix the City’s checks are meant to catch.", "t0": 101.03, "t1": 106.88, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the combination the City’s controls are meant to catch"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.84, 1.22, 1.74, 1.91, 2.4, 3.04, 3.47, 3.66, 3.94, 4.12, 4.5, 4.89, 5.1, 5.25, 5.38]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[5]", "next[4]"], "text": "For the year of the purchase and the loan, the City’s monitoring file reads: Waiver.", "t0": 107.0, "t1": 111.67, "shot": "b17b", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "x21b", "kicker": "Controller · fiscal monitoring of WeHOPE, 2024-25", "text": "monitoring status: “Waiver”", "mark": "Waiver"}, "emph": ["Waiver"], "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.21, 0.43, 0.5, 0.62, 1.14, 1.28, 1.42, 1.98, 2.1, 2.65, 2.96, 3.29, 4.05]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "The records don’t show the price was unfair. Or that any San Francisco money paid for the building.", "t0": 111.89, "t1": 117.05, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That the price was unfair", "That any San Francisco money paid for the building"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.1, 0.48, 0.73, 0.95, 1.11, 1.34, 1.53, 2.23, 2.53, 2.78, 3.01, 3.24, 3.79, 4.11, 4.4, 4.54, 4.64]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? The appraisal and board minutes. And whether the building is billed to any City contract.", "t0": 117.17, "t1": 122.85, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The appraisal, minutes and recusals"}, {"who": "", "what": "Whether the building is billed to a City contract"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.3, 0.59, 0.89, 1.09, 1.64, 1.87, 2.18, 2.73, 3.02, 3.31, 3.41, 3.79, 3.89, 4.26, 4.39, 4.68, 4.99]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status"], "text": "WeHOPE disclosed this itself. No authority has examined it.", "t0": 122.97, "t1": 126.52, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.99, 1.19, 1.84, 2.15, 2.68, 2.85, 3.3]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 126.64, "t1": 129.23, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.35, 0.48, 0.62, 1.45, 1.62, 1.79]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "found": "On the record", "lead1": "Lead 1 · the building", "lead2": "Lead 2 · an insider loan", "lead3": "Lead 3 · no bidding", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "person"}